    "description": "What: on basic-desert a 'Blue Stochastic Squad' (memberless) under a physical 'Blue Platoon' commander watches a PHYSICAL 'Red Squad' (four men) standing 250 m north. Judge: (1) the stochastic observer detects the physical squad (its level book holds a reported contact); (2) it reports SPOT up the chain - the platoon commander hears it; (3) the physical squad never contacts the stochastic unit (it has no body to see). Fail: no contact, no SPOT, or the Red squad's contact pool ever holds the Blue unit. Check: scripts/scenario-regression.sh agg-sees-physical"
